  m_text: 'Hello and welcome to this training workshop provided to you by ChiNew
    Interactive!


    This workshop aims to run you through a series of different
    situations you will face as part of your role, and show you the specific checks
    required in order to successfully hand over a rental vehicle without issue.


    To
    interact with this training workshop, all you need to do is read carefully through
    the text shown here and use your mouse in order to interact with the environment
    in response to the questions given to you.


    Some questions will be given
    to you through a text-based choice, others will need you to interact with the
    environment.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: df95ca30e16bc2a468a2d48e40d3f4d5, type: 2}
