    HintToDisplay: 
  - InfoText: 'Hello and welcome to Day 2 of this interactive training sequence!<br>

      This
      ''day'' will act as an assessment of the content covered in Day 1, allowing
      you to use what you''ve learned in order to complete all the necessary checks
      without instruction.<br>

      Use buttons ''A'' and ''D'' on your keyboard
      to rotate the camera around, and use the left mouse button to interact with
      the car to perform the necessary checks.<br>

      You will find a list of
      different tools on the left hand side in specific segments that will help you
      complete certain tasks.<br>

      To begin, simply press proceed.'
